==Strategy==
Despite the scary combination of enemies here, it's really not that bad. Due to enemy limit, on base hit you will get two groups of peons before facing all the threats here.
Bring a lot of units with piercing damage via [[Long Distance]], [[Wave Attack]], [[Surge Attack]] or [[Explosion]], as they will use the first wave of metal doges as a stepping stone to hit Sleipnir and Le'Noir, greatly damaging and hopefully killing them before Bun Bun arrives.
Octopus cat is also great here since he can block Bun Bun Symbiote's waves that would kill your attackers.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] - Very important for blocking Bun Bun Symbiote's waves and fully stops Brollows from pushing.
*[[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] - Does good damage to the backline thanks to her LD, can keep Zackie Peng from burrowing into your backline.
*[[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]] - Can chip all the dangers in the level with his waves, start stacking him from the start so you have 2-3 on base hit.
*[[Talents|Talented]] [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] - Wave talent can reach the backline and heavily damage Le'Noir.
*[[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] - Can help deal with the Bun Bun Symbiote if it causes too much trouble.
*Talented [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] - Bring him for his Double Bounty talent, as he can give you all the money you need for attackers from the Sir Seals in the startup.
*[[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Crimson Mina]] - Her LD allows her to reach and destroy the backliners, greatly reducing the overall pressure of the stage. She is very fragile, however, so she requires a strong line of meatshields in order to be effective.
*[[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] or other attacker with 400+ range - You will need something for killing Sleipnir and Le'Noir if you end up killing Bun Bun before them.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Empress Chronos (Uber Rare Cat)|Empress Chronos]] - Freezes traited. However, she can be sniped by Waves so be careful.
*[[Count Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Count Yukimura]] - Can quickly kill the Bun Bun Symbiote
*[[Cat Machine (Uber Rare Cat)|Cat Machine MkIII]] - Strong defense against the Bun Bun Symbiote while also having wave shield.
*[[Celestial Child Luna (Uber Rare Cat)|Salvation's Daughter Lunacia]] - Strong Against/Freezes a good number of enemies that appear, and her Wave Shield is undoubtedly helpful here. Explosions will also help clear out the weak peons.
*[[Child of Destiny Phono (Uber Rare Cat)|King of Destiny Phonoa]] - He boasts extreme range and piercing on top of his [[Massive Damage|massive damage]] to Traited. He can kill Sleipnir and Le'noir long before Bun Bun Symbiote is down.
*Any ubers with [[Long Distance]], [[Wave Attack]], [[Surge Attack]] or [[Explosion]] should greately help.

